{"name":"Tractor Red","hex":"#fd0f35","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tractor","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A vehicle used in farms e.g. for pulling farm equipment and preparing the fields.","A movable coop without a floor to allow for free ranging."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To prepare (land) with a tractor.","To drive a tractor."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tractor"},{"term":"red","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The color of the setting sun, blood, and strawberries; the color which is evoked by the longest visible wavelengths (between about 625–740 nm), and a primary additive color.","A revolutionary socialist or (most commonly) a Communist;  a Bolshevik, a supporter of the Bolsheviks in the Russian Civil War."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a red hue.","Having an orange-brown or orange-blond colour; ginger."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/red"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tractor","blocks":[{"text":"A tractor is an engineering vehicle specifically designed to deliver a high tractive effort at slow speeds, for the purposes of hauling a trailer or machinery, such as that used in agriculture, mining or construction. Most commonly, the term is used to describe a farm vehicle that provides the power and traction to mechanize agricultural tasks, especially tillage, and now many more. Agricultural implements may be towed behind or mounted on the tractor, and the tractor may also provide a source of power if the implement is mechanised."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Ford_8N.jpg/330px-Ford_8N.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tractor","wikidata":"Q39495"},{"title":"Red","blocks":[{"text":"Red is the color at the long wavelength end of the visible spectrum of light, next to orange and opposite violet. It has a dominant wavelength of approximately 625–750 nanometers. It is a primary color in the RGB color model and a secondary color in the CMYK color model, and is the complementary color of cyan. Reds range from the brilliant yellow-tinged scarlet and vermillion to bluish-red crimson, and vary in shade from the pale red pink to the dark red burgundy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg/330px-Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red","wikidata":"Q3142"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XTZ-243K.jpg/500px-XTZ-243K.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XTZ-243K.jpg/1280px-XTZ-243K.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/XTZ-243K.jpg/500px-XTZ-243K.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A modern Ukrainian tractor XTZ-243K","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AXTZ-243K.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG/500px-Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG/1280px-Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG/500px-Hayes_Arbegui_2010.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"This Hayes WHDX 70–170 6×6 ballast tractor is also a form of tractor, as are artillery tractors and the power units which pull semi-trucks.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHayes_Arbegui_